        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>At a minimum, the audit system should collect administrator actions for all users and root. Add the following to the "/etc/audit/audit.rules" file: 

-w /etc/sudoers -p wa -k sudoers

OR

# /etc/dodscript.sh</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
